cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Chicago building energy"
abstract: "The properties Chicago's Energy Benchmarking Ordinance requires to report: what they
  reported for data year 2022 and which of them did not report, placed by City building footprint
  where one matched, with how confidently each match was made, and how that reported energy is
  distributed across hexagons and community areas. Total site energy is the fuel use each
  property reported, added up; every figure is owner-reported, and the ordinance covers
  buildings of 50,000 square feet and more."
